From 46c5f22cf0033ffe452aab0ca75e66cf5671a7fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonas Savulionis <jonas@esnet.lt>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:46:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] virtio-blk: support direct I/O for reads and writes

Allow a raw single-queue drive to use one O_DIRECT backing file with
either I/O engine. Get the alignment from the host and handle partial
blocks without changing the sector size seen by the guest.

Preserve the mode across snapshot restore and backing replacement.
Cover overlapping sectors, dirty tracking, flush ordering and retries.

Signed-off-by: Jonas Savulionis <jonas@esnet.lt>
