From 29c04bb6c63b765b52f39cd9be4a0461957c8500 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonas Savulionis <jonas@esnet.lt>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 23:01:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] virtio-blk: honor writethrough when a direct drive's
 FLUSH is declined

For a direct Writeback disk, a guest can decline FLUSH during feature
negotiation. Commit synchronous and staged writes before returning
success. Set RWF_DSYNC on asynchronous writes. Restore the negotiated
behavior on activation and keep it when replacing the backing file.

Signed-off-by: Jonas Savulionis <jonas@esnet.lt>
